        {
          "seq": 1,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "离线转写工具由林悦负责测试，目前只是内部验证，公开发布尚未批准。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "要保存每一段原始录音，用户修改后的转写不能被自动结果覆盖。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 3,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "录音中暂停应该保留音频边界，继续录音之后的时间戳必须连续。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 4,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "噪声场景先测风扇和键盘声音，不要把安静时段编成文字。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 5,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "英文和中文都要测试，混合说话时保留英文产品名称的正确拼写。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 6,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "字幕界面需要明确展示原文和翻译，翻译使用本地模型。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 7,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "模型下载需要联网，录音和纪要处理完全离线，不共享会议内容。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 8,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "测试报告要包括字错率、词错率和转写延迟，不能只写处理成功。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 9,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "今天只讨论这些验收要求，没有完成系统音频采集，也没有确定新版本发布日期。"
        },
        {
          "seq": 10,
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "最后确认，公开发布仍然没有批准，林悦先在周四提交测试报告。"
        }
      ],
      "captions": [
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "Offline transcription tool is being tested by Lin Yue, and is currently only for internal validation; public release has not yet been approved."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "Final confirmation: Public release has not been approved, and Lin Yuejian submitted the test report on Thursday."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "To save each segment of the original recording, the modified transcription cannot be automatically overwritten by the output result."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "The audio boundaries should be preserved when the recording is paused, and the timestamp after resuming the recording must be continuous."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "Noise scenario: first measure fan and keyboard sounds, do not convert quiet periods into text."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "English and Chinese should both be tested, and English product names should be spelled correctly when mixed speech occurs."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "The subtitle interface should clearly display the original text and translation, using a local model for the translation."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "Model download requires internet, recording and note processing are completely offline, and no sharing of meeting content is allowed."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "The test report should include character error rate and word error rate and transcription latency, and should not only mention successful processing."
        },
        {
          "target": "en",
          "revision": 1,
          "text": "Today, only these acceptance requirements will be discussed, without completing the system audio capture, and without determining the release date of the new version."
        }
      ],
